      "content": "It makes sense that the numbers feel undeniable when you're exhausted and overwhelmed—your brain is looking for proof to match the pain. But finances don't measure a father's worth; your presence, love, and stability mean more to them than any bank statement ever will. You're not \"draining\" them—you're part of their foundation, even on the hardest days. Please don't make a permanent decision based on a temporary season; let someone walk beside you through this.",
