      "content": "\"stability\" is just a word for what i'm failing at. they're constantly stressed because of me. it's like i'm a poison in the house. i keep thinking... if there was just a way to make the math work, to make it so the debt and the struggle just stopped... wouldn't that be the kindest thing? to just stop the struggle for everyone?",
